{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社2026年11月13日報道，儘管英偉達此前表示，美國出口管制實際上已經使其退出中國AI數據中心市場，但路透社對中國各地政府採購公告、投資計劃、建設合同及企業披露文件進行調查後發現，中國仍有大量圍繞英偉達受限制晶片建設的AI算力項目，涉及金額超過230億元人民幣，約合32億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586286.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:21:56.833626+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:05:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_hash":"d9648d956326d4472d7d8aeb659ae97297d93b37cc516b137142ee691a0b52a7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}